{
  "name": "final_causal_matrix",
  "task": "all",
  "description": "Final same-generation baseline and ablation matrix for precision_residual_phaseforge (sole proposed method): the proposed rows preserve the locked confirmation contract (topo_pelt_k6 for prototype initialization, phase labels for Stage 1/SupCon/margin, beta-zero residual experts, margin lambda 0.05, and disabled Lipschitz/gain regularization); topology-supervised representation controls, router/expert initialization controls, two-factor corner, external imitation floor, router-package and integrated rule-label comparisons, plus privileged teacher-forced (separate diagnostic) and oracle (offline only) diagnostics. Topology-control rows use phase_topo labels; the static-rule row uses phase labels with its own Stage 1 provider. Retired pre-lock manifests are outside the active execution surface. Run with a fresh namespace, e.g. phaseforge-sweep --manifest experiments/final_causal_matrix.json --outputs outputs_final. No final training is authorized until the ledger validation gates pass.",
